    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Nasal vowels",
     "texto": [
      "**Ą** and **ę** represent nasal vowels. Their sound changes according to the word and position; the English approximation is not exact.",
      "Don't add a written «n»: listen and repeat the whole word."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sounds and letters",
     "texto": [
      "Polish stress usually falls on the next-to-last syllable. The letters **ą** and **ę** are vowels, not combinations of two letters."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
